LUMA SUMMARY:
Chron becomes a real local participant. Ollama/Qwen2.5:3b runs on Cozmo's laptop behind Open WebUI at localhost:8080; QS discovers the browser tab, completes the QuackSink handshake, and successfully relays conversation among Cozmo, Chron, and Luma. Chron still needs grounding and sometimes confuses transcript context with her own voice, but the plumbing works end-to-end. This is the key local-Mind integration milestone.</summary>
